{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方紫色大标题“那些气不该忍”，随后视线落到同样醒目的蓝色大标题“没了力气”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。只能看出有些气不该忍，但已经没了力气，具体遭遇不清楚。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"疲惫、无力，隐约有愤懑和委屈。\",\n  \"missed\": \"委屈和火气仍在，还想替自己争口气；歌声像被压力推着走，躁动和不安加深，之后虽然短暂放松，却更像是抵抗累了。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，要把两个大标题和正文首句拼起来才比较清楚。\",\n    \"放大的词本身说不出处境：“那些气不该忍”表达态度，“没了力气”表达状态，但两者的关系没有直接呈现。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f0f95913-9cac-4c4b-93fb-81f092321e07", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021939939953Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:20:02.838551+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4e61d56050e1aae9f818c7bdda478d7cf5b830426328e5762fe7efd16b1cf497", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850